  "vibe": "Deep hull navy (#1f3242) lit by a single amber lamp (#e8b23c), with pale sea-mist (#dfe6e2) flipping in for the statements and iron-oxide rust (#a34a2c) taking the CTA. Cormorant Garamond sets the titles thin and old-world over Nunito Sans. The world is a working lighthouse: two opposing amber wedges actually rotate at 40°/sec out of a lamp housing above a tapering tower with two rust bands, three wave lines scroll left at 46, 64 and 82px/sec in falling opacity, two gull silhouettes drift on lazy sine paths, and a fog band breathes up and down across the water. Its typewriter beat strikes each glyph at its own tilt and jitter, and its feed beat scrolls a real list with a live scrollbar. Slow zoomOut/drop camera, 0.4 roll. For coastal stays, heritage sites, harbour towns and quiet-luxury hospitality.",
